 32→
 33→    /// Mount the WinFsp filesystem after successful authentication.
 34→    ///
 35→    /// Creates the CipherBoxFS with keys from AppState, pre-populates the root
 36→    /// folder from IPNS, and spawns the WinFsp event loop on a dedicated thread.
 37→    ///
